 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Which one is newer? Sometimes that makes big difference. Look for a small white box on the side or bottom that says the build date. Then the newer one is the one you want. Check the local weather and see how fast the storm moves. Slowly walking in the direct wind is dangerous. I' save it for when the storm passes. You can order another.",
